# PROGRESS.md, SHORTTERM_CONTEXT.md and LONGTERM_CONTEXT.md used to be listed
# here. They were removed on 2026-08-20 because three tracked files pointed
# readers at them (handoff.md, handoff_roce_2026-08-06.md, scripts/find_spark.sh
# and presentation/HANDOFF.md), which made them handoff artifacts that nobody
# outside this laptop could read. A document that is cited as authoritative and
# is also unshareable is the worst of both. They are tracked now; once a file is
# tracked, entries here no longer apply to it anyway.
#
# The three above are genuinely local: finished reports on a finished phase,
# cited only from PROGRESS.md, where the link is flagged as local-only.
